:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"3c64d95c\",\"parentId\":\"0aa25717\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-23T10:18:31.640Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"toolCall\",\"id\":\"call_cdzS2VbAUKXfVjq3IvkQOTyB\",\"name\":\"exec\",\"arguments\":{\"command\":\"rg -n --hidden --no-messages 'oc_r:20260522-101746:8' /home/bhard/.openclaw 2>/dev/null | head -50\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"workdir\":\"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator\"}}],\"api\":\"openai-completions\",\"provider\":\"local-bifrost\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.4\",\"usage\":{\"input\":678,\"output\":264,\"cacheRead\":16512,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":17454,\"cost\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0}},\"stopReason\":\"toolUse\",\"timestamp\":1779531507242,\"responseId\":\"chatcmpl-Didj3p9MNc91CREemfDHUMWe2v3qI\"}}","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779531516091}}
{"type":"message","id":"ab13aae0","parentId":"c5cd1640","timestamp":"2026-05-23T10:18:39.363Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_brrDtFaKduDrteHXU6Gk2rAB","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator/EDITORIAL_FEEDBACK.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":19308,"output":147,"cacheRead":17152,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36607,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779531516100,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DidjCzsU9ANgQV8fKH7CenxNfiRp6"}}
{"type":"message","id":"e1221737","parentId":"ab13aae0","timestamp":"2026-05-23T10:18:39.387Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_brrDtFaKduDrteHXU6Gk2rAB","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# EDITORIAL_FEEDBACK.md — News Card RATE / IMAGE Feedback\n\nThis handles Telegram editorial feedback on published news cards. **Not part of the crypto pipeline.**\n\n---\n\n## When this applies\n\nIf an incoming Telegram message matches **any** of:\n\n| Pattern | Example |\n|---------|---------|\n| Callback prefix `oc_r:` | `oc_r:20260522-101746:8` |\n| Callback prefix `oc_ri:` | `oc_ri:20260522-101746:7` |\n| Callback prefix `oc_ri_menu:` | `oc_ri_menu:20260522-101746` |\n| Text command | `RATE 8`, `IMAGE 7` |\n| Text with alert id | `RATE 9 ta-20260522-101746` |\n\n---\n\n## What to do\n\n1. **Do NOT** start or continue the crypto news pipeline.\n2. **Do NOT** spawn subagents.\n3. **Immediately** run:\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator/skills/pipeline/handle_card_feedback.py \\\n  --payload \"<callback data if present>\" \\\n  --message-text \"<user text if present>\" \\\n  --chat-id \"<telegram chat id>\" \\\n  --user-id \"<telegram user id>\" \\\n  --username \"<telegram username if known>\" \\\n  --reply-to-message-id \"<replied-to message id if present>\"\n```\n\nOmit flags that are not available. Use `--payload` for callback taps; use `--message-text` for plain text replies.\n\n4. Reply to the user with **only** the script stdout (e.g. `RATE_RECORDED: ta-... article=8`).\n5. **End turn.** Do not run validators or pipeline steps.\n\n---\n\n## Pipeline vs feedback\n\n| User says | Route |\n|-----------|-------|\n| `run pipeline`, `run crypto news pipeline` | SOUL.md pipeline |\n| `RATE 8`, taps score button, `IMAGE 7` | This doc |\n\nIf the message explicitly requests the pipeline, pipeline takes precedence.\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- Replying **to the news card** with `RATE 8` works without `@mention`.\n- Callback button taps do not require `@mention`.\n- DRAFT / EDIT are **not implemented** yet (Phase 3).\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779531519387}}
