{"type":"message","id":"8349d7c1","parentId":"1adb360e","timestamp":"2026-05-23T11:04:06.643Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_bKMHL3crLDMPE6PDhezigABq","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"LINE 35\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"a4c9e7a5\",\"parentId\":\"0320e6ad\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-23T10:58:43.035Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"toolResult\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_kCg3GaFCDFZtCde1jxK5akO2\",\"toolName\":\"read\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"# EDITORIAL_FEEDBACK.md — News Card Editorial Feedback\\n\\nHandles Telegram feedback on published news cards. **Not part of the crypto pipeline.**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## When this applies\\n\\n| Pattern | Example |\\n|---------|---------|\\n| Callback `oc_r:` / `oc_ri:` / `oc_ri_menu:` | Rate article or image |\\n| Callback `oc_draft:` / `oc_draft_yes:` / `oc_draft_no:` | Unpublish flow |\\n| Callback `oc_edit:` / `oc_edit_apply:` / `oc_edit_cancel:` | Edit flow |\\n| Text | `RATE 8`, `IMAGE 7`, `DRAFT`, `EDIT` |\\n| Document reply | `.md` file replying to bot's edit prompt |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## What to do\\n\\n1. **Do NOT** start or continue the crypto news pipeline.\\n2. **Do NOT** spawn subagents.\\n3. Run the handler immediately:\\n\\n```bash\\npython3 ~/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator/skills/pipeline/handle_card_feedback.py \\\\\\n  --payload \\\"<callback data if present>\\\" \\\\\\n  --message-text \\\"<user text if present>\\\" \\\\\\n  --chat-id \\\"<telegram chat id>\\\" \\\\\\n  --user-id \\\"<telegram user id>\\\" \\\\\\n  --username \\\"<telegram username if known>\\\" \\\\\\n  --reply-to-message-id \\\"<replied-to message id if present>\\\" \\\\\\n  --document-file-id \\\"<telegram file_id if document upload>\\\" \\\\\\n  --document-name \\\"<original filename if document upload>\\\"\\n```\\n\\n4. **If the handler already sent a Telegram reply, do NOT repeat stdout in the group — end turn silently.**\\n5. If handler failed before replying, show the stdout line to the user.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Pipeline vs feedback\\n\\n| User says | Route |\\n|-----------|-------|\\n| `run pipeline`, `run crypto news pipeline` | SOUL.md pipeline |\\n| RATE, IMAGE, DRAFT, EDIT, callback taps, edit `.md` upload | This doc |\\n\\nPipeline takes precedence only when the message explicitly requests the pipeline.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## EDIT flow notes\\n\\n- Tap **Edit** or reply `EDIT` to the news card.\\n- Bot sends `article-{run_id}.md` as a document.\\n- User must **reply to that document** with a corrected **`.md` file** (not pasted text).\\n- Bot shows **Apply to WordPress** / **Cancel** buttons.\\n- Pasted text during edit → handler returns `EDIT_USE_DOCUMENT`.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## DRAFT flow notes\\n\\n- Tap **Unpublish** or reply `DRAFT` to the card.\\n- Confirm with **Yes, unpublish** / **Cancel**.\\n- Sets WordPress post status to `draft`.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Mention rules\\n\\n- Callback taps: no `@mention` needed.\\n- Reply to news card: `RATE`, `DRAFT`, `EDIT` work without `@mention`.\\n- Reply to bot edit prompt with `.md`: works via `reply_to_bot` implicit mention.\\n\"}],\"isError\":false,\"timestamp\":1779533923035}}\n---\nLINE 43\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"0ef183db\",\"parentId\":\"197ca575\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-23T11:02:51.455Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"[media attached: 2 files]\\n[media attached 1/2: /home/bhard/.openclaw/media/inbound/tmprok8peqa---5cc9db65-d8d9-4f08-8ad2-92dd91cfb345.md (text/markdown) | /home/bhard/.openclaw/media/inbound/tmprok8peqa---5cc9db65-d8d9-4f08-8ad2-92dd91cfb345.md]\\n[media attached 2/2: /home/bhard/.openclaw/media/inbound/tmprok8peqa---e23e7bc1-1c7a-4898-9b2a-a1ccda38b367.md (text/markdown) | /home/bhard/.openclaw/media/inbound/tmprok8peqa---e23e7bc1-1c7a-4898-9b2a-a1ccda38b367.md]\\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Absolute and ~ paths only work when they stay inside your allowed file-read boundary; host file:// URLs are blocked. Keep caption in the text body.\\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"chat_id\\\": \\\"telegram:-1003760909509\\\",\\n  \\\"message_id\\\": \\\"212\\\",\\n  \\\"reply_to_id\\\": \\\"209\\\",\\n  \\\"sender_id\\\": \\\"5691449303\\\",\\n  \\\"conversation_label\\\": \\\"news-agent id:-1003760909509\\\",\\n  \\\"sender\\\": \\\"Sawan bhardwaj\\\",\\n  \\\"timestamp\\\": \\\"Sat 2026-05-23 11:02 UTC\\\",\\n  \\\"group_subject\\\": \\\"news-agent\\\",\\n  \\\"is_group_chat\\\": true,\\n  \\\"was_mentioned\\\": true,\\n  \\\"has_reply_context\\\": true\\n}\\n```\\n\\nSender (untrusted metadata):\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"label\\\": \\\"Sawan bhardwaj (5691449303)\\\",\\n  \\\"id\\\": \\\"5691449303\\\",\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"Sawan bhardwaj\\\",\\n  \\\"username\\\": \\\"hero_fr_fun\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"sender_label\\\": \\\"seo_agent_openclaw_bot\\\",\\n  \\\"body\\\": \\\"Edit ta-20260522-101746\\\\n\\\\nReply to this message with a corrected .md file.\\\\n(Pasted text is not accepted — articles exceed Telegram's limit.)\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n[Telegram news-agent id:-1003760909509 +4m Sat 2026-05-23 11:02 UTC] Sawan bhardwaj (5691449303): <media:document>\\n\\n[Replying to seo_agent_openclaw_bot id:209]\\nEdit ta-20260522-101746\\n\\nReply to this message with a corrected .md file.\\n(Pasted text is not accepted — articles exceed Telegram's limit.)\\n[/Replying]\\n\\n<file name=\\\"tmprok8peqa---5cc9db65-d8d9-4f08-8ad2-92dd91cfb345.md\\\" mime=\\\"text/markdown\\\">\\n\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0dd1f40b6c876002\\\">>>\\nSource: External\\n---\\nMETA\\n- SEO Title: Polymarket Exploit Drains $520K on Polygon\\n- Meta Description: Polymarket exploit drained over $520K on Polygon. The team said a rewards wallet was hit, while core contracts, user funds, and resolution stayed safe.\\n- URL Slug: polymarket-exploit-polygon\\n- Categories: Security, Latest News\\n- Primary Keyword: Polymarket exploit\\n- Secondary Keywords: Polygon, UMA CTF Adapter, ZachXBT, prediction markets\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Polymarket exploit drains $520K on Polygon\\n\\nThe Polymarket exploit is in focus after on-chain investigator ZachXBT flagged more than $520,000 d\n---\nLINE 47\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"66974145\",\"parentId\":\"4183dbce\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-23T11:02:59.863Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"toolResult\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_mu8GFVPLlIytrrnOvKjFsJxf\",\"toolName\":\"read\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"            if score is None:\\n                return None\\n            return {\\\"action\\\": \\\"rate_article\\\", \\\"run_id\\\": art.group(1).strip(), \\\"score\\\": score}\\n        img = _RE_IMAGE_RATE.match(p)\\n        if img:\\n            score = parse_score(img.group(2))\\n            if score is None:\\n                return None\\n            return {\\\"action\\\": \\\"rate_image\\\", \\\"run_id\\\": img.group(1).strip(), \\\"score\\\": score}\\n\\n    if message_text:\\n        text = message_text.strip()\\n        if _RE_TEXT_DRAFT.match(text):\\n            return {\\\"action\\\": \\\"draft\\\", \\\"run_id\\\": None, \\\"alert_id\\\": extract_alert_from_text(text)}\\n        if _RE_TEXT_EDIT.match(text):\\n            return {\\\"action\\\": \\\"edit\\\", \\\"run_id\\\": None, \\\"alert_id\\\": extract_alert_from_text(text)}\\n        img_match = _RE_TEXT_IMAGE.match(text)\\n        if img_match:\\n            score = parse_score(img_match.group(1))\\n            if score is None:\\n                return None\\n            return {\\\"action\\\": \\\"rate_image\\\", \\\"run_id\\\": None, \\\"score\\\": score, \\\"alert_id\\\": extract_alert_from_text(text)}\\n        rate_match = _RE_TEXT_RATE.match(text)\\n        if rate_match:\\n            score = parse_score(rate_match.group(1)